## Summary

Adds a contract guard test for the Delegation Provider Contract introduced in PR #155.

## Scope

- verifies the contract file exists;
- verifies CAP ownership boundaries remain explicit;
- verifies providers remain execution-only;
- verifies provider result is not treated as verified external effect;
- verifies the contract does not define orchestration/runtime concerns.

## Validation

Ran:

`python -m unittest tests/test_delegation_provider_contract_guard.py`

Result: OK (5 tests passed).
